<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ff9bd5">
<title>For my Diana ♡</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --pink: #ff9bd5;
    --light: #fff1fa;
    --deep: #d9479c;
    --ink: #87346e;
    --line: #f5a4d2;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffc7e8, #ff8dce);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, sans-serif;
    padding: 20px 12px 38px;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: auto;
  }
  .tiny {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 4px 0 14px;
  }
  .device {
    background: #29202a;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 9px 0 #bd5e9b, 0 22px 35px #9c407e44;
  }
  .screen {
    display: none;
    min-height: 470px;
    padding: clamp(16px, 4vw, 34px);
    border: 2px solid #ffddf2;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: radial-gradient(#ffffff88 1.5px, transparent 2px),
                radial-gradient(#e94ca566 1px, transparent 2px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #ff8ed0, #ffd0ec);
    background-size: 22px 22px, 18px 18px, auto;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }
  .screen.active {
    display: flex;
    animation: fade .25s ease;
  }
  @keyframes fade {
    from { opacity: .4; transform: translateY(4px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
  .panel {
    width: min(560px, 100%);
    padding: clamp(18px, 4vw, 32px) 16px;
    background: #fff4fbeb;
    border: 2px solid white;
    border-radius: 9px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #f5a3d4;
  }
  h1, h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #ed58ad;
    font-weight: 1000;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .6px;
    text-shadow: 1px 2px white;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.18;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 10px auto;
    max-width: 490px;
  }
  .kitty {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  /* Hello Kitty Face CSS */
  .hello-kitty {
    width: 108px;
    height: 82px;
    position: relative;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 3px solid #e7a4c8;
    border-radius: 48% 48% 43% 43%;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #f4b7d9;
  }
  .hello-kitty:before, .hello-kitty:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 32px;
    width: 7px;
    height: 10px;
    background: #42313c;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .hello-kitty:before { left: 26px; }
  .hello-kitty:after { right: 26px; }
  .hk-ear {
    position: absolute;
    top: -8px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 3px solid #e7a4c8;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .hk-ear.left { left: 5px; }
  .hk-ear.right { right: 5px; }
  .hk-whisker {
    position: absolute;
    width: 22px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #6b5963;
    top: 42px;
  }
  .hk-whisker.l1 { left: -17px; transform: rotate(12deg); }
  .hk-whisker.l2 { left: -18px; top: 51px; }
  .hk-whisker.r1 { right: -17px; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  .hk-whisker.r2 { right: -18px; top: 51px; }
  .hk-nose {
    position: absolute;
    left: 49px;
    top: 43px;
    width: 9px;
    height: 6px;
    background: #f5c84d;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .hk-bow {
    position: absolute;
    right: -12px;
    top: 4px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 22px;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hk-bow:before, .hk-bow:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    width: 14px;
    height: 18px;
    background: #ff4c9a;
    border: 2px solid #e92c80;
    border-radius: 70% 35% 70% 35%;
  }
  .hk-bow:before { left: 0; transform: rotate(-25deg); }
  .hk-bow:after { right: 0; transform: rotate(25deg); }
  .hk-bow i {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    left: 11px;
    top: 7px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: #ff83bd;
    border: 1px solid #e92c80;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    border: 2px solid #e85ca9;
    background: #ffb3de;
    color: #a12d78;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    margin: 8px 4px 0;
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #e88abe;
    font-weight: 800;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .5px;
    transition: transform 0.1s;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn.white {
    background: white;
  }
  .back {
    align-self: flex-start;
    border: 0;
    background: #fff9;
    color: #87346e;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .footer {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #87346e;
  }
  /* Song Box */
  .songbox {
    width: min(420px, 100%);
    margin: 15px auto;
  }
  .songbox iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 152px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  /* Reasons Section */
  .reason-tools {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 14px 0;
  }
  .reason-tools input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 160px;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 2px solid #f5a4d2;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font: inherit;
    background: white;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .reason-tools button {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .progress {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .reason-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 9px;
    max-height: 390px;
    overflow: auto;
    padding: 4px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .reason-card {
    border: 1px solid #f4a1d1;
    background: #fff9fd;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 12px;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    min-height: 82px;
  }
  .reason-card b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #d9479c;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  .reason-card span {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .reason-card.opened {
    background: #ffe1f2;
    border-color: #e65ba9;
  }
  /* Letter */
  .letter {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    white-space: normal;
  }
  /* Future Box */
  .future-box {
    background: #fff0f5;
    border: 2px dashed #ff6b8b;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .future-box h3 {
    color: #d9479c;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .future-box p {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  /* Bouquet */
  .bouquet-box {
    background: #fff0f5;
    border: 2px dashed #ffb6c1;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .bouquet-box .bouquet-icon {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(214, 51, 92, 0.15));
  }
  .bouquet-box h3 {
    color: #d9479c;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .bouquet-box p {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  /* Gifts */
  .gift-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .gift {
    background: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #f5a4d2;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 15px 4px;
    font-size: 25px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #d9479c;
  }
  .gift small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9px;
    margin-top: 7px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .gift-note {
    min-height: 70px;
    background: #fff9fd;
    border: 1px dashed #ed79b8;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .end-note {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a13b7b;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media(max-width: 480px) {
    .reason-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .screen { min-height: 420px; }
    .gift-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<noscript>
  <p style="padding:16px;background:white;color:#87346e;text-align:center">
    Please open this website in a browser with JavaScript enabled so the buttons and 200 reasons can work ♡
  </p>
</noscript>

<main class="wrap">
  <div class="tiny">a little pink world made just for you ♡</div>
  <div class="device">

    <!-- 1. WELCOME -->
    <section class="screen active" id="welcome">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="hello-kitty" role="img" aria-label="Hello Kitty with a pink bow">
          <span class="hk-ear left"></span><span class="hk-ear right"></span>
          <span class="hk-bow"><i></i></span>
          <span class="hk-whisker l1"></span><span class="hk-whisker l2"></span>
          <span class="hk-whisker r1"></span><span class="hk-whisker r2"></span>
          <span class="hk-nose"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="kitty">🎀 HELLO KITTY 🎀</div>
        <h1>I PROMISE<br>YOU'LL LIKE IT</h1>
        <p>i made a tiny something just for my favorite girl</p>
        <button class="btn" data-go="greeting">TO BEGIN ♡</button>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">MADE WITH LOVE FOR DIANA</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. GREETING -->
    <section class="screen" id="greeting">
      <button class="back" data-go="welcome">← BACK</button>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="hello-kitty" role="img" aria-label="Hello Kitty with a pink bow">
          <span class="hk-ear left"></span><span class="hk-ear right"></span>
          <span class="hk-bow"><i></i></span>
          <span class="hk-whisker l1"></span><span class="hk-whisker l2"></span>
          <span class="hk-whisker r1"></span><span class="hk-whisker r2"></span>
          <span class="hk-nose"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="kitty">HELLO KITTY LOVES YOU ♡</div>
        <h1>HAPPY GIRLFRIEND'S DAY</h1>
        <h2>MY SWEET BABY</h2>
        <p>for my diana · my niña bonita · my princesa</p>
        <p>you deserve little reminders of how loved you are, so i made you a whole world of them</p>
        <button class="btn" data-go="song">I'M READY ♡</button>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">YOUR GENNIE WENNIE ♡</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. SONG -->
    <section class="screen" id="song">
      <button class="back" data-go="greeting">← BACK</button>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kitty">♫ 🎀 ♫</div>
        <h2>THIS SONG REMINDS ME OF YOU</h2>
        <p>every time this song plays my mind finds its way back to you</p>
        <div class="songbox">
          <iframe title="Our song on Spotify" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/37zuIvk4KBkAxxLJsxJaHq?utm_source=generator&theme=0" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
        </div>
        <p>it reminds me of your voice, our little names for each other, and the future i imagine with you. one day i want to play it beside you, pull you close, and look at you instead of a screen.</p>
        <button class="btn" data-go="reasons">NEXT ♡</button>
        <button class="btn white" data-action="spotify">OPEN IN SPOTIFY ↗</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. REASONS -->
    <section class="screen" id="reasons">
      <button class="back" data-go="song">← BACK</button>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kitty">♡ 🎀 ♡</div>
        <h2>200 REASONS I LOVE YOU</h2>
        <p>two hundred little reminders for my diana — open any card to read it ♡</p>
        <div class="reason-tools">
          <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search reasons or number…" aria-label="Search reasons">
          <button class="btn" data-action="random">SURPRISE ME ♡</button>
        </div>
        <div class="progress" id="progress">0 / 200 little reasons opened ♡</div>
        <div id="reasonGrid" class="reason-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <button class="btn" data-go="letter">READ MY LETTER ♡</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. LETTER + FUTURE + BOUQUET -->
    <section class="screen" id="letter">
      <button class="back" data-go="reasons">← BACK</button>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kitty">💌🎀</div>
        <h2>HELLO THERE, MY LOVE!</h2>
        
        <div class="letter">
          my diana ♡<br><br>
          i wish you could see yourself through my eyes even for a second because maybe then you would understand why loving you has never felt like a burden to me. your emotions are not too much, your fears do not make you hard to love, and the days when you struggle do not make me want you any less. i love you as a whole person not just the easy happy parts but the quiet complicated parts too.<br><br>
          i know distance can make everything feel harder and i wish i could close it with one hug. i imagine our home and our kitchen island and the ordinary little moments that will one day belong to us. until then i want to keep choosing you with patience honesty and actions that match my words.<br><br>
          you are my niña bonita my princesa my universe and my favorite future. you do not have to earn my tenderness by being okay all the time. come to me as you are. i want to keep learning you and loving you better every day.<br><br>
          te quiero muchísimo mi amorcito<br><br>
          love always<br>
          your gennie ♡
        </div>

        <!-- Future Reassurance -->
        <div class="future-box">
          <h3>🌅 A little promise about our future</h3>
          <p>
            Whenever you worry about what's ahead, I want you to remember this: I'm not going anywhere. I picture our future not as something uncertain, but as a beautiful adventure we get to build together, one day at a time. We'll have quiet mornings and silly arguments, big dreams and small victories. Through every season, my hand will be right there in yours. I am so incredibly excited to walk through life with you, Diana — not just for the highlights, but for every ordinary, wonderful moment in between.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Bouquet of Flowers -->
        <div class="bouquet-box">
          <div class="bouquet-icon">💐</div>
          <h3>A bouquet of flowers for you</h3>
          <p>
            Since I can't hand you a real bouquet right now, imagine these: bright, beautiful, and always blooming, just like my love for you. 🌸🌹🌼🌷
          </p>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" data-go="gifts">OPEN YOUR SURPRISE GIFTS 🎁</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. GIFTS -->
    <section class="screen" id="gifts">
      <button class="back" data-go="letter">← BACK</button>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kitty">🎁🐱🎀</div>
        <h2>SURPRISE GIFTS FOR YOU!</h2>
        <p>pick a little gift, my love ♡</p>
        <div class="gift-grid">
          <button class="gift" data-gift="0">🎀<small>GIFT 01</small></button>
          <button class="gift" data-gift="1">🎀<small>GIFT 02</small></button>
          <button class="gift" data-gift="2">🎀<small>GIFT 03</small></button>
          <button class="gift" data-gift="3">🎀<small>GIFT 04</small></button>
        </div>
        <div class="gift-note" id="giftNote">choose one of your little surprises ♡</div>
        <button class="btn" data-go="welcome">START AGAIN ♡</button>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">MADE FOR YOU, ALWAYS ♡</div>
    </section>

  </div>
  <p class="end-note">made with all my love for diana ♡</p>
</main>

<script>
  // ---------- KEEPING YOUR 200 REASONS EXACTLY AS THEY ARE ----------
  const reasons = [
    "You are my Diana, the girl my heart keeps choosing.",
    "Because somehow my Diana became the person my heart looks for in every little moment of the day.",
    "Because with you I can imagine a kind of love where neither of us has to pretend to be unbreakable.",
    "You let me imagine a future that feels warm instead of frightening.",
    "You make distance feel worth crossing.",
    "You are the person I want beside me in the ordinary parts of life.",
    "You make me want to become gentler without asking me to become someone else.",
    "Because out of all the people I could have met in this huge world I got to meet the girl I call my universe.",
    "You are beautiful in ways that have nothing to do with a mirror.",
    "Because I can be having the longest day and still catch myself imagining your smile and feeling a little lighter.",
    "Because I could listen to you talk about absolutely nothing and still think it was time well spent.",
    "I love the way you can stay on my mind even when we are doing completely different things.",
    "I love that I can miss you while we are still talking.",
    "You make even a little moment together feel important.",
    "You make me want to tell you every small thing that happens in my day.",
    "Because even the thought of your name can interrupt my day and make me smile like an idiot.",
    "You are my princesa, not because you need saving but because you deserve tenderness.",
    "You are my mi niña bonita, even on the days you do not feel pretty.",
    "You are my universe in a way I cannot fit into one sentence.",
    "I love that you call me your gennie wennie and make it feel special.",
    "I love our little names for each other because they belong to us.",
    "I love how being yours feels both exciting and peaceful.",
    "You make me want to keep learning you, not just assume I already know you.",
    "I want to understand the things you say and the things you struggle to say.",
    "I love that there is always another little detail about you I can discover.",
    "I want to know your favorite things and the stories behind them.",
    "Because I want to learn every tiny thing that makes my Diana laugh even the silly things you think nobody would remember.",
    "Because I want to remember the little details you mention once and forget you even told me because they matter to me when they matter to you.",
    "I want to keep earning the trust you give me.",
    "I love that loving you gives me a reason to be patient.",
    "I love that your feelings matter to me, even when I cannot fix what hurts.",
    "Your emotions are not a burden I have to carry; they are part of you I want to understand.",
    "You do not have to be cheerful for me to love you.",
    "You do not have to hide the difficult days to deserve my affection.",
    "You are not hard to love just because you have complicated feelings.",
    "You are not too much for me just because you feel things deeply.",
    "Because you never have to say sorry for needing your gennie wennie to reassure you or sit with you through a hard feeling.",
    "I love you on the quiet days as much as on the happy ones.",
    "I want you to feel safe enough to tell me when something hurts.",
    "I want my love to feel steady, not like a test you have to pass.",
    "Because when the world gets loud and your thoughts get cruel I want you to know you can come to me without having to make yourself easier to love first.",
    "I love the parts of you that you are still learning how to accept.",
    "Because if you need to put your walls back up while you work through things I will meet you with patience instead of demanding that you open up before you are ready.",
    "Because giving you space should never mean making you wonder whether I still love you; I want to respect your pace and keep my care steady.",
    "I want you to know that one hard day will not erase all the love I have for you.",
    "I want to listen before I try to solve anything.",
    "I want to understand your fears instead of judging you for having them.",
    "I love how much your heart cares, even when that caring overwhelms you.",
    "I want to remind you of your worth when your own thoughts are unkind to you.",
    "I love you as a whole person, not only the easy parts.",
    "I love your softness, even when you try to hide it.",
    "I love your strength, including the quiet kind nobody claps for.",
    "I am proud of you for making it through days that felt impossible.",
    "I love the courage it takes for you to let someone close.",
    "I love that you are still here, still trying, still becoming yourself.",
    "I want you to feel chosen without having to compete for my attention.",
    "You deserve reassurance that is honest and consistent.",
    "I want my actions to make my promises feel real.",
    "I never want you to feel that you have to earn basic kindness from me.",
    "I want to keep showing you that your heart is safe with mine.",
    "I love the way you make me think about forever in a real, everyday way.",
    "I can picture a home with you, full of little routines that belong to us.",
    "Because I can picture our future kitchen island with you leaning beside me while we talk about everything and absolutely nothing.",
    "Because someday I want to make you something warm after a hard day and let home feel like the safest place for both of us.",
    "I imagine hearing your voice from another room and smiling without thinking.",
    "I imagine grocery shopping with you and turning it into our own little date.",
    "I imagine quiet evenings where being together is enough.",
    "I imagine us laughing at something ridiculous while doing chores.",
    "I imagine a future where we can reach for each other without a screen between us.",
    "I want to learn how you like your coffee, tea, and comfort food.",
    "I want to make our future feel like a home, not just a place.",
    "Because the dream that gets me most is not some perfect fairytale but an ordinary day where I wake up and you are there.",
    "I want to see the places that made you who you are.",
    "I want to show you the places that mean something to me too.",
    "I want to build memories with you that do not need a perfect camera angle.",
    "I want to celebrate your little wins like they are important, because they are.",
    "I want to be there for birthdays, quiet Sundays, and every in-between day.",
    "I want to grow beside you instead of expecting either of us to be perfect.",
    "I want to keep choosing you through different seasons of life.",
    "I want our future to be full of honest talks and repaired misunderstandings.",
    "I love that the thought of marrying you feels tender rather than just dramatic.",
    "I want to build a life where we both get to breathe and be ourselves.",
    "I love how much meaning a future with you has started to hold.",
    "I want to see you surrounded by the things that make you happy.",
    "I want to make you feel loved in ways you can actually feel, not only read.",
    "I want to keep learning what makes you feel cared for.",
    "I want to become better at giving you the kind of comfort you need.",
    "I love that loving you makes me pay attention to the little things.",
    "I want to remember important dates and the tiny details behind them.",
    "I want to bring you flowers just because a day with you is worth celebrating.",
    "Because lilies will always make me think of you and I want to give you a bouquet that feels like I picked every flower while thinking of my girl.",
    "I would choose a bouquet for you based on what makes you smile, not what looks impressive.",
    "I want to see your face when you receive something chosen just for you.",
    "Because I want to leave you little notes that remind you you are loved even on a day when I cannot be beside you to say it myself.",
    "I want to make you gifts that feel like a piece of my heart made visible.",
    "I love imagining you opening a small surprise and realizing I thought of you.",
    "I want to make you feel cherished on ordinary Tuesdays, not only special occasions.",
    "I want to celebrate the things you love even when they are not my own favorites.",
    "Because I love making this tiny pink Hello Kitty world for you and imagining you smiling at all the little details made just for my Diana.",
    "I would happily learn all your favorite cute little things just to know you better.",
    "I love the idea of a pink little corner of the internet made only for you.",
    "Because I want these 200 reasons to be something you can come back to whenever your mind tries to convince you that you are too much or not enough.",
    "I want every reason here to feel like a tiny letter tucked into your pocket.",
    "I love the music that gives you a glimpse into your heart.",
    "I think of you when I hear songs that sound like longing and devotion.",
    "Because Lana Del Rey songs like Young and Beautiful and Video Games make me imagine loving you through every version of life we get.",
    "I love how a song can suddenly sound like it was waiting for us.",
    "Because The Marías and Cariño make me picture a soft little moment with you where the whole world can wait while I hold you close.",
    "I love the idea of dancing with you even if we are both terrible at it.",
    "I want to hear the songs you love and learn why each one matters.",
    "I want to make playlists that feel like little maps back to each other.",
    "I love that music gives us another language for the feelings that are hard to explain.",
    "Because I want to send you a song and have you hear the part of my heart I was trying to put into it for you.",
    "I love the thought of singing softly with you in the kitchen.",
    "I want to share quiet car rides where the music says what we cannot.",
    "I love the romantic little world we can build from songs, words, and memories.",
    "I want to learn the stories behind the lyrics that move you.",
    "I love how love can turn an ordinary song into a memory of you.",
    "I love imagining us somewhere warm, with golden evening light around us.",
    "I dream of a home that feels peaceful, with Mexican warmth and a kitchen full of life.",
    "I want to try foods with you and hear your opinions about every bite.",
    "I want to learn your favorite dishes and make them for you someday.",
    "I love the thought of exploring a market with you and buying things we do not need.",
    "I want to share sunsets with you and never rush the moment.",
    "I want to sit beside you outside and let the evening go quiet.",
    "Because I love calling you mi niña bonita mi princesa and mi amorcito and I want every Spanish word I give you to feel like a little kiss.",
    "I love calling you mi amorcito because the words feel warm when they are meant for you.",
    "I want to say te quiero and te amo in ways you can feel beyond the words.",
    "I love the thought of giving you a forehead kiss when you are tired.",
    "I want to hold your hand in public and make it feel natural and easy.",
    "I want to pull you close when the world feels cold, if that is what you want.",
    "I want to learn the small gestures that make you feel most loved.",
    "I want to know how you like to be comforted without making you explain it every time.",
    "I want to make room for your laughter, your silence, and your honest answers.",
    "I love the way affection can live in a look, a message, or a tiny touch.",
    "I want to notice when you need gentleness before you have to ask.",
    "I want to be the person you can tell the truth to, even when it is messy.",
    "I love that we can create our own language from nicknames and inside jokes.",
    "I want to collect little memories with you like seashells from a long trip.",
    "I love that you can make me feel close even when miles are between us.",
    "I love that you are worth the waiting and the planning and the effort.",
    "Because I refuse to let the miles be the only thing our story is about; I want them to be the chapter before I can finally hold you.",
    "Because I imagine our first real hug feeling like all the missing and waiting finally has somewhere to go.",
    "I imagine holding you and being quiet because the moment says enough.",
    "I want to remember the first time I see you and how your face looks in real life.",
    "I want to learn the rhythm of being beside you, not just talking through a phone.",
    "I love the hope that distance gives our reunions a special kind of meaning.",
    "I want to be patient with the time it takes for us to close the miles.",
    "I want to make plans with you that turn missing each other into something hopeful.",
    "I want to keep showing up in small ways while we wait for bigger moments.",
    "I love that we have a reason to look forward to the future together.",
